          Green vs Red <span class="text-[#38BDF8]">Laser Level</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Green beams look brighter to the human eye at the same power. That one fact explains the price gap, the battery gap, and why the right choice depends on the rooms you work in.
